ress&fm=webp&fit=crop&crop=top&w=200&h=200&s=7bf8e6123b79e2e9f4266c2faecd24a3", "thumbnail_srcset": "https://si.imgix.net/dfdcc508/uploads/origins/bcc33f33-a413-4c3c-8f7a-15cd515e3250?bg=%23fff&auto=format%2Ccompress&fm=webp&fit=crop&crop=top&w=200&h=200&s=7bf8e6123b79e2e9f4266c2faecd24a3, https://si.imgix.net/dfdcc508/uploads/origins/bcc33f33-a413-4c3c-8f7a-15cd515e3250?bg=%23fff&auto=format%2Ccompress&fm=webp&dpr=2&fit=crop&crop=top&w=200&h=200&s=ce307a9346f1c1bb34a34f36f88d1979 2x, https://si.imgix.net/dfdcc508/uploads/origins/bcc33f33-a413-4c3c-8f7a-15cd515e3250?bg=%23fff&auto=format%2Ccompress&fm=webp&dpr=3&fit=crop&crop=top&w=200&h=200&s=8c99337874a229e6e3385eedeb76a722 3x", "genre": "art", "nsfw": false, "body": "Hello! I was browsing and saw your beautiful artwork. I was inspired to make a request.\n\nWould you be alright drawing my Vtuber, Hoshino Ink? She is a fallen star. She wants to become an idol and grant wishes. She loves tapioca tea, matcha, frogs, and books. Her personality is gentle and silly.  I trust the artist with the pose and expression.\n\nHair: White and black. Black is star coloured.\nEyes: Rainbow. Or Pink and blue.\nCharm Point: Starry design. \n\nUsage:\n- SNS\n- YouTube Thumbnails\n\nThank you for your consideration!\n\nhttps://drive.google.com/file/d/18dC8yA3gxPIXPunnAVy8F0pwvQDUnEwM/view?usp=sharing", "created_at": "", "completed_at": ""}, {"path": "/@taochm/works/21", "thumbnail_src": "https://si.imgix.net/96823f85/uploads/origins/bf2afb01-ef3b-4014-85a9-7c347f4ff167?bg=%23fff&auto=format%2Ccompress&fm=webp&fit=crop&crop=top&w=200&h=200&s=4bb4de1db6115b3b98ae716921d949b5", "thumbnail_srcset": "https://si.imgix.net/96823f85/uploads/origins/bf2afb01-ef3b-4014-85a9-7c347f4ff167?bg=%23fff&auto=format%2Ccompress&fm=webp&fit=crop&crop=top&w=200&h=200&s=4bb4de1db6115b3b98ae716921d949b5, https://si.imgix.net/96823f85/uploads/origins/bf2afb01-ef3b-4014-85a9-7c347f4ff167?bg=%23fff&auto=format%2Ccompress&fm=webp&dpr=2&fit=crop&crop=top&w=200&h